# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# These two are edited on every Goal and are stored as CRLF in the object
# store (see the markdown note below). With `* text=auto` plus a Windows
# checkout (core.autocrlf=true), any local edit re-normalizes the WHOLE file to
# LF on `git add` — a one-line change shows up as a 673-line diff, and every
# session paying that cost makes review noise. `-text` pins their storage:
# edits keep whatever line endings the file already has, no conversion either
# way. (Whitespace gate unaffected: it already runs with `cr-at-eol`.)
CHANGELOG.md -text
docs/progress.md -text

# Java / Maven
*.java text diff=java
*.xml text
*.properties text eol=lf

# Shell scripts
*.sh text eol=lf
# Maven wrapper：容器内直接执行，Windows 检出必须保持 LF（#479）
mvnw text eol=lf
# mvnw 用 `while IFS= read -r` 逐行读取这两个文件并拼进 MAVEN_OPTS；read -r 只去掉
# \n 不去掉 \r，CRLF 检出会把 `-Xmx2g\r` 原样传给 java（Invalid maximum heap size）。
# 与 mvnw 同理，必须锁定 LF。
.mvn/jvm.config text eol=lf
.mvn/maven.config text eol=lf

# Windows batch
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Web
*.html text
*.css text
*.js text
*.ts text
*.vue text
*.json text
*.yaml text
*.yml text
*.svg text

# Markdown may legitimately sit in the object store as CRLF: `docs/progress.md`
# is (5020 CR bytes at 3385e4dd, appended to on every Goal). Without this,
# `git diff --check` counts the CR of every added line as trailing whitespace,
# so a docs-only PR that appends to progress.md reports ~92 violations and the
# CI gate (#895) looks broken the moment it is armed. `cr-at-eol` exempts only
# the CR: a real trailing space and a leftover conflict marker still fail
# (verified — see _orchestrate/reports/PH10_report.md §4).
#
# `-blank-at-eof` additionally: the release flow appends to CHANGELOG.md, and
# two of the most recent docs commits (51da4666, 38134bf7) end with a blank
# line at EOF. With the default rule armed, the gate's first real runs would
# fail on the repo's own legitimate commits and invite `|| true` back. A
# trailing blank at EOF is cosmetic for these docs; real trailing spaces and
# conflict markers still fail (verified on 51da4666^..51da4666 after the
# change: exit 0, while a synthetic trailing space / conflict marker: exit 2).
*.md whitespace=cr-at-eol,-blank-at-eof

# Binary
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary

# Signed catalog payloads must be byte-identical on every checkout: the
# Ed25519 signature (provider-catalog.sig) covers the exact manifest bytes,
# so line-ending normalization would break verification on CRLF checkouts.
backend/provider-adapters/src/main/resources/catalog/* -text
